  "homepage": "https://github.com/dimanovikov/datadiff",
  "description": "Runs kubectl diff with datadiff as the diff program. Instead of a line\ndiff of YAML it prints each field that changed, such as\nspec.replicas: 3 → 5. Key order and formatting are ignored, and with\n--key name list items such as containers and env vars are matched by\nname, so reordering them is not a change.\n\ndatadiff options such as --key, --ignore and --fail-on go to datadiff,\nand every other argument goes to kubectl diff unchanged.\n",
